WEBVTT

00:05:28.824 --> 00:05:32.745
Now how would you do something like that?
After all, the whale is a living system.

00:05:32.787 --> 00:05:35.748
The whale captures carbon on her body,

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.750
and she gives birth to baby whales

00:05:37.792 --> 00:05:40.669
who also grow up
to capture carbon on their body.

00:05:40.711 --> 00:05:44.048
And they give birth
to whales and so forth,

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.467
and indirectly through
the fertilization of phyto.

00:05:46.509 --> 00:05:49.011
So how would you do something like this?

00:05:49.053 --> 00:05:50.554
Well, to do that,

00:05:50.596 --> 00:05:55.851
I had to resort to what I do best,
which is valuation.

00:05:55.851 --> 00:05:58.145
I looked at it, I said, wait a minute.

00:05:58.145 --> 00:06:01.524
This looks like a share of stock
that pays dividends.